{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18949","headline":"敬宗睿武昭愍孝皇帝挽歌三首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"敬宗睿武昭愍孝皇帝挽歌三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"任贤劳梦寐，登位富春秋。\n欲遂东人幸，宁虞杞国忧。\n长杨收羽骑，太液泊龙舟。\n惟有衣冠在，年年怆月游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}